course: dictionary
lesson: 11875
title: One word, several meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning. The word «boxers» has three, so the words around it tell you which one the writer means. Look for clues such as clothes, a ring, or an animal.
explain: «Mum packed three pairs of boxers for our trip.» Packing and pairs tell you boxers are underwear here. «The two boxers stepped into the ring and put on their gloves.» The ring and the gloves show the sport of boxing.
explain: «The boxer wagged its tail when we opened the door.» Wagged and its tell you the boxer is an animal, a dog. Always ask: which meaning fits this sentence? Then try it in the sentence to check that it makes sense.
fact: Boxers can mean underpants, people who fight in the sport of boxing, or a breed of dog.
fact: «Boxers» as underpants is a plural noun, as in «a pair of boxers» or «boxer shorts».
fact: «Boxer» on its own means one person in the sport, or one dog of the breed.
fact: Boxing is a sport where people fight with their fists in padded gloves.
fact: A boxer dog is a strong dog with a short coat.
exercise: «Mum packed three pairs of boxers for our trip.» What are boxers here? | Padded gloves for a fight | Dogs that run very fast | *Loose cotton underpants | Long trousers for school
exercise: «The two boxers stepped into the ring and put on their gloves.» What does boxers mean? | Loose cotton underpants | A breed of strong dog | Gloves sold in a shop | *People who fight with their fists in the sport of boxing
exercise: «The boxer wagged its tail and barked at the postman.» What kind of boxer is this? | A pair of underpants | A referee | A fighter in a ring | *A strong dog
test: «The shop sold boxers in packs of three.» What are boxers in this sentence? | Shoes | Dogs | *Underpants | Gloves
test: «The boxer barked loudly at the cat.» Which meaning fits best? | *A dog | Underpants | A person who fights in a ring | A pair of gloves
exam: «Professional boxers train every day to win their fights.» Which meaning of boxers fits, based on the words train and fights? | A breed of short-haired dog | Padded pillows for a bed | *People who fight in the sport of boxing | Loose cotton underpants
